1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
I will become a Cinder Nova who shines even brighter than Anchan did! I swear I will!

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,000
And even if I become the Cinder Nova, I will not disappear!

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Since her shocking declaration of her desire to become the Cinder Nova,

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,000
9th generation Yugo Oshima's popularity has been rising rapidly!

5
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Yugo's just so inspiring!

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Such intensity!

7
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:22,000
I'm in love!

8
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,000
The election of 75th generation trainee Memori Kishida

9
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:29,000
and 77th generation trainee Chieri Soto has also sparked much discussion.

10
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:32,000
The next major event everyone is looking forward to is succession.

11
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Currently, the trainee most likely to become a successor is...

12
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:36,000
I think it's Chieri-chan!

13
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:39,000
Memori's great, but Chieri's way more popular!

14
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:44,000
The right name for Chieri-chan? Hmm, that's a good question.

15
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:46,000
What about Mayu Yu?

16
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:49,000
You idiot, there's already Mark II. It'll be Jirina.

17
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:50,000
What? Not Ami?

18
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:52,000
With the elected member's first theater hall performance coming up, everyone...

19
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:55,000
Things are starting to get exciting!

20
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:00,000
A-chan...

21
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:01,000
Huh?

22
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:02,000
Hmm...

23
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:08,000
Oh my! The Kiraras of succession are buzzing with excitement!

24
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Oh!

25
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:17,000
Am I crazy? Or was that the original A-chan?

26
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:20,000
Hurry! We have to inform Tsubasa-sama!

27
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:22,000
Shall I?

28
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:23,000
Do you?

29
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:48,500
Sm prosk

30
00:01:48,500 --> 00:01:59,500
長い桜の前 未来があるなら 背を向けられない

31
00:01:59,500 --> 00:02:06,500
ともよ覚えているかい あの日 誓い合ったこの場所

32
00:02:06,500 --> 00:02:11,500
季節の花が咲く

33
00:02:11,500 --> 00:02:24,800
主なきその声聞こえるよ 太陽がほら少しずつ当たりのその闇を剥がしてくれるだろ

34
00:02:24,800 --> 00:02:38,540
主なきさあこの時に僕たちはそう歩き出そう 誰もみんな弱い生き物さ

35
00:02:38,540 --> 00:02:45,040
愛の気配探しながら先へ進む

36
00:03:08,540 --> 00:03:12,240
They even have gotten even more popular since they were elected

37
00:03:12,240 --> 00:03:17,040
People are saying Chiyari might even succeed Achan. Crazy, huh?

38
00:03:17,040 --> 00:03:21,540
Yeah, no kidding. At this rate, it may actually be possible.

39
00:03:21,540 --> 00:03:24,040
We've got to make sure we don't fall behind.

40
00:03:24,040 --> 00:03:27,440
Hey! Let's chat more work.

41
00:03:27,440 --> 00:03:31,540
Okay, Chiyari will succeed Achan.

42
00:03:31,540 --> 00:03:32,540
Ah-Chan.

43
00:03:40,540 --> 00:03:43,040
Really now? So you're going to succeed Ah-Chan?

44
00:03:43,040 --> 00:03:45,040
Please don't joke about that.

45
00:03:45,040 --> 00:03:47,040
Is there someone else you want to succeed?

46
00:03:47,040 --> 00:03:49,040
That's not what I meant.

47
00:03:49,040 --> 00:03:51,040
I would be happy to succeed anyone.

48
00:03:51,040 --> 00:03:53,040
It'd be a great honor no matter who it was.

49
00:03:53,040 --> 00:03:54,540
That goes for all of us.

50
00:03:54,540 --> 00:03:57,040
But everyone would love to be Ah-Chan.

51
00:03:57,040 --> 00:04:00,040
One, two, three, four.

52
00:04:00,040 --> 00:04:04,040
I don't care which it is. Just show me something today.

53
00:04:04,040 --> 00:04:07,040
Eyes forward. Everyone ready?

54
00:04:07,040 --> 00:04:10,040
The show's tomorrow. Let's bust our butts!

55
00:04:10,040 --> 00:04:11,040
Right!

56
00:04:11,040 --> 00:04:16,040
Hey, that photographer. What is she doing here?

57
00:04:16,040 --> 00:04:20,040
You're in trouble, Buddha. You don't have your fake boobies, do ya?

58
00:04:20,040 --> 00:04:21,040
No? Crap!

59
00:04:21,040 --> 00:04:26,040
Make her feel welcome. Starting today, she will be our exclusive photographer.

60
00:04:26,040 --> 00:04:28,040
It's a pleasure to be here.

61
00:04:28,040 --> 00:04:31,040
I'm freelance photographer Mikako Minamino.

62
00:04:31,040 --> 00:04:35,040
I'm actually your senior, fifth generation Minagishi Minami.

63
00:04:35,040 --> 00:04:36,040
Or...

64
00:04:36,040 --> 00:04:37,040
Just Mi-Chan.

65
00:04:37,040 --> 00:04:38,040
What?!

66
00:04:42,040 --> 00:04:44,040
Wow. It's really her.

67
00:04:44,040 --> 00:04:45,040
You've got to be kidding!

68
00:04:45,040 --> 00:04:46,040
Of course it is.

69
00:04:46,040 --> 00:04:51,040
The fifth generation Mi-Chan is in one of the photos of the Centanovas back at the dormitory.

70
00:04:51,040 --> 00:04:53,040
You should check them when we get back.

71
00:05:03,040 --> 00:05:04,040
Good, good!

72
00:05:04,040 --> 00:05:05,040
What's going on?

73
00:05:05,040 --> 00:05:09,040
Entertainment regulations are getting more strict. It's made it hard for her to work.

74
00:05:09,040 --> 00:05:12,040
What you're saying is she begged you for a job?

75
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:22,040
If it's truly your intention to bring back the Centanova position, I'll do everything I can to stop you. You can count on that.

76
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:27,040
Chan-chi! Nice smile! Chan-mi! Nice pose!

77
00:05:29,040 --> 00:05:33,040
That's what incredible bodge you've got there! Show it off!

78
00:05:33,040 --> 00:05:37,040
No one can stop them from shining as bright as they can, Mi-Chan.

79
00:05:37,040 --> 00:05:41,040
Huh? Oh, are you worried about what I said on Atomistar?

80
00:05:41,040 --> 00:05:45,040
Don't worry about it. I was just jealous. It's all good now.

81
00:05:45,040 --> 00:05:50,040
Funny. I can't count the number of times I was jealous of you back when we were performing.

82
00:05:50,040 --> 00:05:54,040
That's nice to hear, but I failed to become the Centanova back then.

83
00:05:55,040 --> 00:05:59,040
You came closer than I did. Look after these girls for me.

84
00:06:11,040 --> 00:06:13,040
You're shining, Mi-Chan.

85
00:06:13,040 --> 00:06:14,040
You're shining, Mi-Chan.

86
00:06:14,040 --> 00:06:15,040
I'm shining.

87
00:06:23,040 --> 00:06:33,040
Alright.

88
00:06:34,040 --> 00:06:36,040
That key balance!

89
00:06:36,040 --> 00:06:38,040
But there's still just the more?

90
00:06:38,040 --> 00:06:51,040
I...

91
00:06:53,040 --> 00:06:55,040
I won't lose.

92
00:06:55,040 --> 00:06:57,040
No matter what!

93
00:06:57,040 --> 00:07:00,040
Am I crazy? Or has Nagisa been acting weird?

94
00:07:00,040 --> 00:07:02,040
What? You think so?

95
00:07:04,040 --> 00:07:07,040
Like Yuko-san!

96
00:07:07,040 --> 00:07:10,040
Wow, they're terrible.

97
00:07:10,040 --> 00:07:13,040
I don't see dynamic!

98
00:07:13,040 --> 00:07:16,040
What is wrong with you?

99
00:07:16,040 --> 00:07:18,040
Nagisa!

100
00:07:18,040 --> 00:07:20,040
You too, Chieri!

101
00:07:20,040 --> 00:07:21,040
Yuko-san?

102
00:07:21,040 --> 00:07:23,040
What's up? Please tell me you're slacking.

103
00:07:23,040 --> 00:07:26,040
You can shine so much brighter than that!

104
00:07:29,040 --> 00:07:31,040
Sorry.

105
00:07:37,040 --> 00:07:42,040
I guess she's done with practice for today.

106
00:07:42,040 --> 00:07:45,040
Don't worry about Yuko. More importantly…

107
00:07:45,040 --> 00:07:46,040
Nagisa!

108
00:07:46,040 --> 00:07:47,040
Huh?

109
00:07:47,040 --> 00:07:49,040
Come with me. We need to talk.

110
00:07:49,040 --> 00:07:52,040
Okay. Is Yuko feeling alright?

111
00:07:52,040 --> 00:07:55,040
Maybe she's feeling the pressure from winning first place.

112
00:07:55,040 --> 00:07:57,040
And I'm Santa Claus.

113
00:07:59,040 --> 00:08:01,040
Mayuyu, is something wrong?

114
00:08:01,040 --> 00:08:04,040
Tsubasa, she left already.

115
00:08:04,040 --> 00:08:06,040
She's just got a lot on her plate.

116
00:08:06,040 --> 00:08:09,040
I feel a storm brewing! It's gonna go boom!

117
00:08:09,040 --> 00:08:12,040
A storm brewing? You heard right!

118
00:08:12,040 --> 00:08:17,040
There's a rumor that a new successor is about to be chosen!

119
00:08:21,040 --> 00:08:25,040
The Keiraros of Succession showed the original Achan's image.

120
00:08:25,040 --> 00:08:27,040
Does this mean someone will succeed her?

121
00:08:27,040 --> 00:08:30,040
That's the only explanation.

122
00:08:30,040 --> 00:08:32,040
Whoever succeeds her.

123
00:08:32,040 --> 00:08:35,040
When the 14th generation Atsuko Medea is born…

124
00:08:35,040 --> 00:08:36,040
Achan…

125
00:08:36,040 --> 00:08:38,040
What will happen to you?

126
00:08:43,040 --> 00:08:44,040
That light…

127
00:08:46,040 --> 00:08:47,040
That was Achan's…

128
00:08:48,040 --> 00:08:49,040
No doubt.

129
00:08:50,040 --> 00:08:51,040
Nagisa Morimiya…

130
00:08:51,040 --> 00:08:52,040
Or Chieri Sono…

131
00:08:53,040 --> 00:08:54,040
Michan…

132
00:08:55,040 --> 00:08:58,040
You think one of them might become Achan and it's eating you up?

133
00:08:58,040 --> 00:09:00,040
Right on the money.

134
00:09:01,040 --> 00:09:02,040
Michan…

135
00:09:02,040 --> 00:09:04,040
Why did you stop shining?

136
00:09:04,040 --> 00:09:05,040
Huh?

137
00:09:06,040 --> 00:09:09,040
It's not that I stopped, I just couldn't.

138
00:09:10,040 --> 00:09:11,040
You couldn't?

139
00:09:11,040 --> 00:09:12,040
Why not?

140
00:09:12,040 --> 00:09:14,040
It's hard to explain really.

141
00:09:14,040 --> 00:09:17,040
Someone who's never been there wouldn't understand anyway.

142
00:09:18,040 --> 00:09:21,040
Chanyu, you're into photography, right?

143
00:09:21,040 --> 00:09:22,040
Yeah, that's right.

144
00:09:23,040 --> 00:09:26,040
Those worthy of being the center nova have a certain sense.

145
00:09:26,040 --> 00:09:29,040
It's not something that can be taught or acquired.

146
00:09:29,040 --> 00:09:30,040
What sense?

147
00:09:31,040 --> 00:09:32,040
They can seize a moment.

148
00:09:33,040 --> 00:09:37,040
Their own brilliance resonates with others who shine in the same way.

149
00:09:37,040 --> 00:09:39,040
They can capture the moment of that light.

150
00:09:40,040 --> 00:09:42,040
Just like taking a picture.

151
00:09:43,040 --> 00:09:46,040
You look at your subject and snap a shot at just the right moment.

152
00:09:46,040 --> 00:09:50,040
And when you do that, then you can capture the light.

153
00:09:51,040 --> 00:09:54,040
If that's really true, it might tell us which one will become Achan.

154
00:09:55,040 --> 00:09:56,040
Of course.

155
00:09:57,040 --> 00:09:59,040
It only works if you have the aptitude.

156
00:10:02,040 --> 00:10:03,040
Yuko, what's wrong?

157
00:10:04,040 --> 00:10:06,040
Oh, you're taking pictures! Take one of us!

158
00:10:07,040 --> 00:10:08,040
Okay, sure.

159
00:10:08,040 --> 00:10:13,040
Jerry and Nagisa?

160
00:10:14,040 --> 00:10:15,040
I haven't seen them.

161
00:10:16,040 --> 00:10:17,040
Thanks anyway!

162
00:10:27,040 --> 00:10:30,040
Sonata, if you've got nothing better to do, train with me!

163
00:10:30,040 --> 00:10:31,040
I'll pass.

164
00:10:32,040 --> 00:10:35,040
Good call, Sonata. I wouldn't work that hard.

165
00:10:36,040 --> 00:10:38,040
Your stomach will end up looking like a chocolate bar if you do.

166
00:10:39,040 --> 00:10:40,040
Are you okay, Memori?

167
00:10:41,040 --> 00:10:42,040
What are you talking about?

168
00:10:42,040 --> 00:10:44,040
I don't know. You just seemed really beat.

169
00:10:45,040 --> 00:10:46,040
I'm perfectly fine.

170
00:10:47,040 --> 00:10:48,040
Cool.

171
00:10:49,040 --> 00:10:50,040
Just checking.

172
00:10:51,040 --> 00:10:52,040
Hey! Hey!

173
00:10:53,040 --> 00:10:54,040
Huh?

174
00:10:55,040 --> 00:10:57,040
Nagisa's late.

175
00:10:58,040 --> 00:11:00,040
She said she'd be right here.

176
00:11:03,040 --> 00:11:04,040
Oh, she's here!

177
00:11:04,040 --> 00:11:05,040
Sorry, girls! It's just me!

178
00:11:06,040 --> 00:11:07,040
Yuko-san?

179
00:11:07,040 --> 00:11:08,040
Is something wrong?

180
00:11:09,040 --> 00:11:10,040
You're on candid camera!

181
00:11:11,040 --> 00:11:12,040
What?!

182
00:11:20,040 --> 00:11:22,040
I understand you look up to Yuko a great deal.

183
00:11:22,040 --> 00:11:27,040
However, trying to be like someone else won't make you a successor.

184
00:11:28,040 --> 00:11:31,040
I understand. It's the nature of my soul, right?

185
00:11:32,040 --> 00:11:33,040
That's not all.

186
00:11:34,040 --> 00:11:35,040
Huh?

187
00:11:35,040 --> 00:11:36,040
It's your ambition.

188
00:11:36,040 --> 00:11:37,040
Ambition?

189
00:11:38,040 --> 00:11:43,040
It's when your heart is looking at where it wants to be, then fights tooth and nail to get there.

190
00:11:44,040 --> 00:11:47,040
Succession is about inheriting the ambition of a previous soul.

191
00:11:47,040 --> 00:11:51,040
Inheriting the ambition of a previous soul.

192
00:11:52,040 --> 00:11:53,040
Hmm.

193
00:11:53,040 --> 00:11:54,040
Nagisa! Are you there?

194
00:11:55,040 --> 00:11:56,040
Oh!

195
00:11:56,040 --> 00:11:57,040
Yuko-san?

196
00:11:57,040 --> 00:11:58,040
Oh!

197
00:11:59,040 --> 00:12:00,040
Oh!

198
00:12:00,040 --> 00:12:01,040
Chenmi looks like a model!

199
00:12:02,040 --> 00:12:03,040
Her boobs are enormous!

200
00:12:04,040 --> 00:12:06,040
Hey! Don't imitate Michan-san!

201
00:12:08,040 --> 00:12:09,040
Hm? What was that?

202
00:12:10,040 --> 00:12:11,040
Makoru's stomach growling!

203
00:12:11,040 --> 00:12:12,040
Oh, right.

204
00:12:12,040 --> 00:12:14,040
I guess it's about that time, isn't it?

205
00:12:15,040 --> 00:12:16,040
Memori!

206
00:12:16,040 --> 00:12:17,040
It's time for dinner.

207
00:12:18,040 --> 00:12:20,040
Shall we go to the cafeteria, then?

208
00:12:21,040 --> 00:12:22,040
Huh?

209
00:12:23,040 --> 00:12:24,040
Memori!

210
00:12:25,040 --> 00:12:26,040
Memori!

211
00:12:26,040 --> 00:12:27,040
Are you okay, Memori?

212
00:12:27,040 --> 00:12:39,040
The Kiraras of Succession are doing it again!

213
00:12:42,040 --> 00:12:43,040
Yuko-san!

214
00:12:44,040 --> 00:12:45,040
Can I take a picture of you?

215
00:12:45,040 --> 00:12:46,040
What?

216
00:12:46,040 --> 00:12:47,040
Yeah, sure.

217
00:12:47,040 --> 00:12:48,040
I guess that's okay.

218
00:12:49,040 --> 00:12:50,040
Thanks a bunch!

219
00:12:53,040 --> 00:12:54,040
Does this work?

220
00:12:55,040 --> 00:12:56,040
Works for me!

221
00:12:56,040 --> 00:12:57,040
But, uh…

222
00:12:57,040 --> 00:12:58,040
Won't it be backlit?

223
00:12:58,040 --> 00:12:59,040
It's fine!

224
00:12:59,040 --> 00:13:00,040
Don't worry about that!

225
00:13:00,040 --> 00:13:01,040
Trust me!

226
00:13:01,040 --> 00:13:02,040
This is perfect!

227
00:13:02,040 --> 00:13:03,040
Okay.

228
00:13:06,040 --> 00:13:07,040
Huh.

229
00:13:07,040 --> 00:13:09,040
I guess just taking a picture won't work.

230
00:13:10,040 --> 00:13:12,040
Do you need another one or something?

231
00:13:12,040 --> 00:13:13,040
Oh, no!

232
00:13:13,040 --> 00:13:14,040
Don't worry about it!

233
00:13:15,040 --> 00:13:16,040
Later!

234
00:13:17,040 --> 00:13:18,040
Wait!

235
00:13:18,040 --> 00:13:21,040
This afternoon at practice, what did you mean?

236
00:13:22,040 --> 00:13:25,040
You said that Chiari and I could shine brighter than what we were.

237
00:13:27,040 --> 00:13:29,040
I meant exactly what I said.

238
00:13:30,040 --> 00:13:32,040
I said it because you two are my biggest rivals.

239
00:13:33,040 --> 00:13:34,040
When it comes to the Center Nova.

240
00:13:35,040 --> 00:13:36,040
The Center Nova?

241
00:13:37,040 --> 00:13:38,040
You really mean that?

242
00:13:39,040 --> 00:13:40,040
But I'm still only a trainee.

243
00:13:41,040 --> 00:13:42,040
Uh…

244
00:13:42,040 --> 00:13:43,040
In next year's general elections, I will!

245
00:13:43,040 --> 00:13:46,040
I will definitely beat Ahchan and become the Center Nova!

246
00:13:46,040 --> 00:13:47,040
Just you watch!

247
00:13:48,040 --> 00:13:49,040
That's right.

248
00:13:49,040 --> 00:13:51,040
So then, work on shining brighter.

249
00:13:52,040 --> 00:13:54,040
Otherwise, it's not a competition, is it?

250
00:13:57,040 --> 00:13:58,040
Hey, come quick!

251
00:13:58,040 --> 00:13:59,040
Memori's sick!

252
00:13:59,040 --> 00:14:00,040
Huh?

253
00:14:00,040 --> 00:14:01,040
Memori-san?

254
00:14:01,040 --> 00:14:10,040
The Kiraros of Succession displayed Memori's image.

255
00:14:11,040 --> 00:14:12,040
Then…

256
00:14:12,040 --> 00:14:13,040
Yes.

257
00:14:13,040 --> 00:14:15,040
There's no mistaking this fever.

258
00:14:15,040 --> 00:14:17,040
Memori's going to become a successor.

259
00:14:19,040 --> 00:14:20,040
Well, I'll be.

260
00:14:20,040 --> 00:14:23,040
Come to think of it, you had a fever just before your succession, right?

261
00:14:23,040 --> 00:14:24,040
Yes.

262
00:14:24,040 --> 00:14:26,040
It was just before a concert.

263
00:14:26,040 --> 00:14:28,040
I got a fever and was groaning in my sleep.

264
00:14:28,040 --> 00:14:30,040
A lot like Memori is now.

265
00:14:31,040 --> 00:14:32,040
That was the first time I sensed it.

266
00:14:32,040 --> 00:14:37,040
I felt Mariko Shinado's soul as if it were my own.

267
00:14:39,040 --> 00:14:40,040
Huh.

268
00:14:40,040 --> 00:14:44,040
